   Machova, Kristyna; Nekovarova, Tereza; Svobodova, Ivona, Czech Univ Life Sci, Fac Agrobiol Food \& Nat Resources, Dept Ethol \& Compan Anim Sci, Prague 16500, Czech Republic.
   Jurickova, Veronika; Nekovarova, Tereza, Natl Inst Mental Hlth, Dept Appl Neurosci \& Neuroimaging, Klecany 25067, Czech Republic.
